---
title: "Claude activity: source evidence, recovery and stop boundary"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Provider busy: unknown, watcher absent
  s1: Provider busy: busy, watcher absent
  s2: Provider busy: unknown after lease expiry, watcher absent
  s3: Provider busy: busy, watcher attached
  s4: Provider busy: unknown after one recovery cycle, watcher absent
  s5: Provider busy: unknown after lease expiry, watcher attached
  s6: Provider busy: unknown after one recovery cycle, watcher attached
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: read current source activity
  s0 --> s2: expire hints and recheck
  s1 --> s3: recover watcher
  s1 --> s2: expire hints and recheck
  s2 --> s4: new source progress renews lease
  s3 --> s5: expire hints and recheck
  s4 --> s1: read current source activity
  s5 --> s6: new source progress renews lease
  s6 --> s3: read current source activity
